rpowering dungeon until she comes along, taking out the opposition in a single blow. Mimiru accompanies this Gardenia look-a-like to the bottom floor of the dungeon where they are faced by a supposedly invincible enemy, so to protect Mimiru, she uses a skill that crystallises her character but guarantees the enemies death. Mimiru goes to the bottom level of this dungeon with Bear once again to find her mentors form, still preserved perfectly, standing in the exact same position as when she used her fatal skill."}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":1143,"malId":1143},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-30T07:57:40Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:1143","mal:1143"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-v2","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1135","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"222","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"24","scope":"S"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"447","scope":"S"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"5391","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"5459","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"5459","scope":"S"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"7883","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"7883","scope":"S"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"8606","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"8606","scope":"S"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"10390"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"110286"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"11375"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1143","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1487"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1994"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"2928"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3269"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"4469"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"454"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"9332"},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt0823406"},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt1164545"},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt2064704"},{"provider":"mal","id":"10390"},{"provider":"mal","id":"11375"},{"provider":"mal","id":"1143","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"1487"},{"provider":"mal","id":"2928"},{"provider":"mal","id":"36646"},{"provider":"